  step,dige:11e5d0398a0133fc
  step=2,desc:load Atlas and Lagoon on demand — stand Atlas on the frozen corpus and the reader beside it,dige:0237d87d658e884b
    Assertion:the-reader-ghost-loads,sentence:the reader ghost loads on demand beside the census — no manifest edit needed
    Assertion:the-reader-reports-which,sentence:the reader reports which censuses are standing — it looks them up and never holds them
  step=3,desc:the reader answers over a census it does not own — who calls the fixture method — with its enclosing def,dige:0237d87d658e884b
    Assertion:a-reader-answers-over,sentence:a reader answers over a census it does not own — who calls this — with the enclosing def
  step=4,desc:the lint answers over the same census — counting the corpus it was given and faulting on nothing,dige:daa2964c11f5ab89
    Assertion:the-lint-answers-over,sentence:the lint answers over the same census and faults on nothing in a frozen corpus
  step=5,desc:the seek is one answer over every standing census — and it names which ones replied,dige:e59b40795481d423
    Assertion:the-seek-is-one,sentence:the seek is one answer over the censuses that are standing — and it names which replied
    Assertion:a-census-that-is,sentence:a census that is standing but holds nothing is reported apart from one that answered
  step=6,desc:the shape of a document is held not computed — the defs inside its bead and the one beyond it,dige:262b9d7faed01354
    Assertion:a-document-declares-its,sentence:a document declares its own beads — what sits inside one is attributed to it and what sits beyond is left outside
  step=7,desc:a reader with no census refuses BY NAME — never a throw and never a silent empty,dige:4b51f10f490f552b
    Assertion:a-reader-with-no,sentence:a reader with no census refuses by name — never a throw and never a silent empty
    Assertion:every-reader-refuses-the,sentence:every reader refuses the same way — the named exit is the layer rule and not one verb
  step=8,desc:the reader kept nothing — after every answer its world holds only its own report row,dige:a469983f5545cefa
    Assertion:the-reader-kept-nothing,sentence:the reader kept nothing — after every answer its world holds only its own report row
